        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG750, Stainless Steel Mail Slot</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese PVD Titanium coated mail slot doors from <a href=\"/collections/ahi\"><b>AHI Hardware</b></a>  are extremely resistant to corrosion, knocks, scratches and abrasion making it an ideal material for door hardware. It needs little looking after and does not degrade in appearance or function with use. Includes exterior and interior mail doors with a satin finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG750_size.gif?v=1704354717\" width\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"AHI SIG750 Stainless Steel Mail Slot Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for AHI SIG750 Stainless Steel Mail Slot\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 13\" (330 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 3-15/16\" (100 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Mail Door Width: 10-1/4\" (260 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Mail Door Height: 2-1/8\" (55 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Interior Mail Door Width: 10-1/4\" (260 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Interior Mail Door Height: 2-1/8\" (55 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SIG750.pdf?v=1691093349\" target=\"new\"><b>AHI SIG750 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
